WEBVTT

00:02:28.907 --> 00:02:33.596
Then, everyone else fell
into a deep sleep.

00:02:33.596 --> 00:02:37.284
The shaman and his sister 
yelled and shook them,

00:02:37.284 --> 00:02:38.564
but they wouldn’t wake.

00:02:40.514 --> 00:02:43.504
It was getting dark, 
so the shaman and his sister

00:02:43.504 --> 00:02:48.245
tied the pineapple sprout outside 
the hollow log and crawled inside.

00:02:48.245 --> 00:02:52.690
A strong wind rose—
the mark of the air goblins.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.780
It broke branches 
and brought down trees.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:59.190
Caymans, boas and jaguars roared.

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:01.690
The water began to rise.